    "Re-record" : {
      "comment" : "A button label for re-recording a calibration take.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Read the passage below once for each condition. Recording more than one is what lets the app still recognise you when you change how you speak — measured, a single take made the app silence its own dentist whenever he lowered his voice." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bacakan naskah di bawah ini satu kali untuk setiap kondisi. Merekam lebih dari satu memungkinkan aplikasi tetap mengenali Anda ketika cara bicara Anda berubah — dari pengukuran, satu rekaman saja membuat aplikasi membisukan dokter giginya sendiri setiap kali ia menurunkan suaranya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Record" : {
      "comment" : "A button label.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Record the normal take and register your voice first. Until then the app cannot tell you from anyone else in the room, and every voice would reach the chart." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rekam versi normal dan daftarkan suara Anda terlebih dahulu. Sampai saat itu, aplikasi tidak dapat membedakan Anda dari orang lain di ruangan, dan setiap suara akan masuk ke bagan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Record the quiet take too. Without it the app will withhold your dictation whenever you speak softly." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rekam juga versi pelan. Tanpa itu, aplikasi akan menahan dikte Anda setiap kali Anda berbicara pelan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Registering your voice…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mendaftarkan suara Anda…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
